%% B. Detailed data flow — v1.1 two-track intake to claim-based report
flowchart TB
  U["User"] -->|choose analyses; offer? yes / type terms / explore| START["Start: data-mode banner + consent"]
  START --> TRACK1["Track 1: household intake"]
  START --> TRACK2["Track 2: offer (runs in parallel)"]

  TRACK1 --> Q["next-question: blocking first (dependency order), then refinement"]
  Q -->|typed answer| F["Fact ledger (append-only; status x verification; declined)"]
  Q -->|free text, paid mode only| P["LLM #1 parse (whitelisted keys)"] --> F
  F --> RULES["Rules: hard conflicts clarify; H01 deficit / H02 plausibility acknowledge once"]
  RULES --> READY["AnalysisReadiness per analysis (from engine required_inputs)"]
  READY -->|unavailable analysis| Q
  READY -->|all selected available or declined| STOPQ["Stop core questions; offer refinements"]

  TRACK2 -->|upload| GATE{"LLM_DATA_MODE allows this document?"}
  GATE -->|no| MAN["Manual offer entry (same checks)"]
  GATE -->|yes| TXT["PyMuPDF text layer + redaction"]
  TXT --> EXT["LLM #2 extraction: label, value, page, quote; offers count; itemization"]
  TXT --> RDR["Deterministic TILA-box reader"]
  EXT --> VER["Verifier: quote, label anchor, reader agreement, arithmetic, itemization, APR warn, range, product booleans"]
  RDR --> VER
  VER --> CH{"More than one offer?"}
  CH -->|yes| PICK["User chooses offer"] --> TBL
  CH -->|no| TBL["Verification table: per-field confirm / edit / missing"]
  MAN --> OFF
  TBL --> OFF["LoanOffer ready_for_calculation"]
  OFF -->|awaiting_offer cleared| READY

  STOPQ --> ENG["engine.compute: F00 principal → F01–F05 → F06 → F13 / F14 → F07–F11 → flags"]
  OFF --> ENG
  ENG --> SC["scenarios: paired runs (without / with offer), floor + unfunded gap, break-even 3 / 6"]
  ENG --> CFX["counterfactual: cash down, term (same rate assumed), optional add-ons, verified offers → Pareto"]
  SC --> CFX
  ENG --> CLM["Claim builder"]
  SC --> CLM
  CFX --> CLM
  CLM --> TPL["Templates + key points (no free generation)"]
  TPL --> REP["DecisionReport (readiness, key_points, data_mode, claims, evidence)"]
  REP --> UI["Dashboard: key points · with this loan · under stress · alternatives · missing info · assumptions"]
  UI --> U
